              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ncobeni wakali kuciswa loko, kali afwiifwi akufwa, pele Leza wakamufwida lweetelelo, nkabela teensi nguwe luzutu iwakeetelelwa pe, ndakeetelelwa ambebo, kuti entayungizizigwi aamwi mapenzi atala ayaayo ngenjisi kale. ",
